operational. Without an investment into the facility, the tower will approach end of life condition
and will struggle to support the national airspace.  The tower also plays a vital role for the Air
National Guard (ANG). This facility is used for training controllers for the Air Force. The required
maintenance for this tower is necessary for the continued support of the ANG and the
